  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">DELINEATIO</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Totius Operis.</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="2" para="true">Rerum totò orbe gesta-</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2">rum feries ad tria generalia Inter-</l>
    <l n="5" type="heading" level="2">valla, <i>Antemonarchicum</i> nempe, <i>Mo-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>narchicum Orientale</i>, &amp; <i>Monarchicum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>Occidentale</i>, reduci &amp; alligari</l>
    <l n="8" type="heading" level="2">poteft.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">I. <i>Antemonarchicum intervallum</i> decurrit à rerum</l>
    <l n="10">exortu ad <i>πανυσλεθεία</i> regni Judaici per Ne-</l>
    <l n="11">bucadnezarem, &amp; captivitatem Babylonicam,</l>
    <l n="12">circumscribiturque aliquot periodis.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">1. Eft Antediluviana, a primis rerum initiis ad</l>
    <l n="14">diluvium.</l>
    <l n="15" para="true">2. Postdiluviana, eaque</l>
    <l n="16" para="true">1. Sub Noachi posterisab egreffu ejusdem</l>
    <l n="17">ex arca ad ingreffum Israelita-</l>
    <l n="18">rum in Aegyptum.</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">2. Sub Aegyptiaca servitute &amp; peregrina-</l>
    <l n="20">tione in deserto ad ingressum in</l>
    <l n="21">terram Canaan sub Josua.</l>
    <l n="22" para="true">3. Sub Judicibus, tam prioribus feptem,</l>
    <l n="23">quam posterioribus ad erectio-</l>
    <l n="24">nem regni Judaici sub Samuele.</l>
    <l n="25" para="true">4. Sub Regibus Israelis &amp; Judæ, ante &amp; post</l>
    <l n="26">fecessionem decem tribuum, ad</l>
    <l n="27">deportationem eorundem per</l>
    <l n="28">Salmanassarem,</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">5. Sub</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Several words in the Greek phrase and the mixed-case heading are uncertain; the Greek "πανυσλεθεία" is a doubtful reading. The Latin "Salmanassarem" is read from a partly obscured line.</notes>
